    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 166 Millpark to the Clondalkin property market. \r\n\r\nOn entrance to this apartment, we are welcomed with a spacious hallway, large and bright open plan, kitchen / dining room. The property has a master bedroom, en-suite, second double bedrooms and a family bathroom. There are two balconies which are accessible from the living room. \r\n\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Clondalkin Village, the location is truly next to none. Literally on your doorstep you will find a selection of amenities including The Mill Shopping Centre, Clondalkin Leisure Centre, The Round Tower, both primary & secondary schools, and a choice of bars & restaurants. Bus routes are within arm’s reach and The Luas & M50 motorway are accessible within minutes by car.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation, gardens and excellent location this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
